    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuɛn Bo-ɛ̈dh kɛ Ruth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn ruun waaŋ ëë, cu Bo-ɛ̈dh wä nyuur guäth dolä ji̱ Juudh thok rɛ̈ɛ̈k. Kä cu ran maarä Ɛ-li-mɛ-lɛk ëë lat Bo-ɛ̈dh ɛ ben ɛ cath cath, cu Bo-ɛ̈dh jɛ jiök i̱, “Ŋuuŋu, bër inɛ kä nyuurä wanɛ mi,” kä cuɛ ben nyuur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bo-ɛ̈dh wutni da̱ŋ wäl ti di̱t cɔl, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Nyuɔ̱ɔ̱rɛ wanɛ mi,” kä cukɛ nyuur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bo-ɛ̈dh wut maarädiɛn ku jiök i̱, “Kak dämandan ni Ɛ-li-mɛ-lɛk, kɔakɛ jɛ ɛ ciekdɛ ni Na-omi, mëë luny jɔk rööl Mo-ab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän, kɛ ca̱rä kärɔa, cä jɛ car i̱ bä ji̱ la̱r lär, ku jɛ kɔk nhiam nɛɛni ti te nyuurä ti, kä nhiam di̱tni wecdan. Ɛ jɛn, mi bi kui̱ maarädu la̱t, ɛ jɛn gɔaa. Kä mi /ci̱ jɛ bi luäŋ kɛ lätni, läri jɛ ɣä, kä bä cu ŋa̱c, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ radɔ̱diɛn mi dee jɛ la̱t ɛ ni ji̱n kɛ nhiam, kä kɛ jɔak rɛwdu ɣän.” Kä cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Bä jɛ kɔk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bo-ɛ̈dh jɛ lɛni jiök i̱, “Ɛn cäŋ ɔ bi kɔk ni kak ɔ tetdä Na-omi mɔ, bi nyaa Mo-ab ni Ruth mat thi̱n bä, min mɔ ciëk jɔkä, kɛ ɣöö bi ciöt jɔkä jiɛc rɛy ganmani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu wut maarä ɛ loc i̱, “Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, ɣän /cä jɛ bi luäŋ kɛ lätni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, kɛ ciaŋ I-thɛ-rɛl ëë wal kɛ kui̱ kökä kɛnɛ guäcni kä ŋɔaani, kɛ ɣöö bi mɔmɔ ca la̱t ɔ a thuɔ̱k, la käm ram kɛl war cio̱kdɛ raar kä bɛ jɛ ka̱m ram in dɔ̱ŋ. Ɛ jɛn ciaŋ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛnɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛnɔ, mëë ci wut maarä Bo-ɛ̈dh jiök i̱, “Kɔk ɛ,” cuɛ warɛ woc kä cuɛ jɛ ka̱m Bo-ɛ̈dh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ cu Bo-ɛ̈dh di̱t kɛnɛ nɛy diaal ku jiök i̱, “Kɛ yɛn neen ɛn walɛ kä cia jɛ nɛn täämɛ ɛn ɣöö cä ti̱n diaal ti̱n tɔ nyin Ɛ-li-mɛ-lɛk kɔk, a amäni nyin Kil-yon diaal kɛnɛ Maa-lɔn bä, cä kɛ kɔk tetdä Na-omi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min te ni jɛn thi̱n, cä Ruth nyaa Mo-ab ciëk Maa-lɔn mat thi̱n ala ciëkdä kɛ ɣöö bä ciöt jɔkä jiɛc rɛy ganmani kɛnɛ ji̱ matdä wecdɛ. Kɛ yɛn neen ɛn walɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal ti̱n te nyuurä thok rɛ̈ɛ̈k kɛnɛ di̱t jɛ lar i̱, “Ɣɔ̱ɔ̱n, ɛ jɛn, lakɔ neen. Kä a Kuoth Nhial jak ciëk ɛmɔ ci kuɛn ɔ ce̱tnikɛ Re-cɛl kɛnɛ Leya tëë ca Je-kɔb di̱eth kuay ti ŋuan. A ria̱ŋdu di̱t thok duëël Ɛp-ra-tha, kä a kɛ̈kdu jɔc kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A gaat ti̱n bi Kuoth Nhial kɛ ka̱m ji̱ kɛ nyaa mɔ, jakɛ thok dueelu kä di̱t ce̱tkɛ thok duëël Pɛ-rɛdh mëë di̱ethkɛ Juda ɛ Ta-mar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gua̱ndɔɔŋni Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ jɛn, cu Bo-ɛ̈dh Ruth jakä ciekdɛ, kä cuɛ wä kä jɛ duëël, kä cu Kuoth Nhial jɛ moc gat kä cuɛ dap kɛ gat dhöl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu män rɛ̈ɛ̈k Na-omi jiök i̱, “A puɔ̱th tekɛ Kuoth Nhial in ci ji̱ jakä ti̱i̱ kɛ ram mi tekɛ lua̱ŋ kɛ kui̱du ɛn walɛ. A ciöt gatä kɛ̈kɛ kä I-thɛ-rɛl, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bɛ yi̱eyku luɔ̱ɔ̱c kä bɛ ji̱ bum rɛy dɔŋädu, kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ dap ɛ ciëk gatdu, min mɔ nho̱o̱kdu, kä le̱ny gua̱a̱thdɛ gaat ti ŋuan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Na-omi gat ka̱n kä cuɛ jɛ bom, kä cuɛ jɛ la rɔɔmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ ëë cakɛ ni ciötdɛ cu ji̱ thie̱e̱kädiɛn ŋar kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaay kä larkɛ jɛ i̱, “Ca Na-omi di̱eth gat.” Kä cukɛ ciöt gatä cɔl i̱ O-bɛd. Cuɛ la gua̱n Jɛthi, gua̱n Dee-bid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn kuay Pɛ-rɛdh, Pɛ-rɛdh ɛ gua̱n Ɣɛdh-ron, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu Ɣɛdh-ron a gua̱n Raam, kä cu Raam a gua̱n A-mi-na-dab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu A-mi-na-dab a gua̱n Na-con, kä cu Na-con a gua̱n Thal-mɔn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu Thal-mɔn a gua̱n Bo-ɛ̈dh, kä cu Bo-ɛ̈dh a gua̱n O-bɛd, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu O-bɛd a gua̱n Jɛthi min mɔ gua̱n Dee-bid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
